      "text": "func double(v int) { v *= 2 }  // v is a local copy\ndouble(x)  // x is still 42! v*=2 only changes callee's copy\nFix: return new value  OR  pass pointer  OR  use method on pointer receiver",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
