      "originalText": "func double(p *int) { *p *= 2 }  // dereference and write through\ndouble(&x)  // x is now 84 - mutation visible in caller!\nAssembly: MOVQ (AX), BX ; SHLQ $1, BX ; MOVQ BX, (AX)  (AX holds &x)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
