      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TRAP 1  Returning pointer to loop variable: for i:=range xs { ptrs=append(ptrs,&i) } - all point to same i!\nTRAP 2  unsafe.Pointer + uintptr arithmetic: GC may move heap objects - uintptr is NOT kept alive by GC!\nTRAP 3  Pointer to interface: &iface doesn't work as expected - always use pointer to concrete type",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TRAP 1  Returning pointer to loop variable: for i:=range xs { ptrs=append(ptrs,&i) } - all point to same i!\nTRAP 2  unsafe.Pointer + uintptr arithmetic: GC may move heap objects - uintptr is NOT kept alive by GC!\nTRAP 3  Pointer to interface: &iface doesn't work as expected - always use pointer to concrete type",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
